{title: Mortal Bodies Live}
{subtitle: Romans 8:11}
{key: Eb}
{tempo: 87}
{time: 3/4}

{comment: Intro}
| [Eb] | [Eb] | [Eb] | [Eb] |
| [Eb] |

{start_of_verse: Verse 1}
Those who are in the [Bb]flesh cannot please [Ab]God
But you [Eb]are not in the flesh, you [Bb]are in the Spirit
The [Ab]Spirit of Christ [Cm]dwells deep within
If [Bb]He is not in you, [Ab]you do not belong to [Cm]Him
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_chorus: Chorus}
The Spir[Bb]it of Him [Eb]who raised Jesus from [Ab]the dead
Will [Bb]give life to your mor[Eb]tal bodies
[Cm]Through His Spirit who dwells [Ab]in you
[Bb]The dead become [Cm]alive, the grave cannot hold
{end_of_chorus}

{start_of_verse: Verse 2}
The body [Ab]is dead [Bb]because of [Eb]sin
But the Spirit is life [Bb]because of righteous[Cm]ness
We have an obliga[Ab]tion to walk in [Eb]a new way
Not to the flesh, [Bb]but to the Spirit's [Cm]holy sway
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_chorus: Chorus}
[Ab]The Spirit of Him who [Bb]raised Jesus from the [Ab]dead
Will give [Bb]life to your mor[Eb]tal bodies
[Cm]Through His Spirit who dwells [Ab]in [Bb]you
The dead be[Cm]come alive, the grave cannot [Ab]hold
{end_of_chorus}

{start_of_bridge: Bridge}
If [Bb]by the Spir[Eb]it you [Ab]put to death the deeds
Of [Bb]the body, you will live
Led [Cm]by the Spirit of God
[Ab]You are children of [Bb]God
{end_of_bridge}

{start_of_chorus: Chorus}
The Spir[Ab]it of Him [Bb]who raised Jesus from the [Ab]dead
Will give [Bb]life to your mor[Eb]tal bodies
[Cm]Through His Spirit who dwells [Ab]in [Bb]you
The dead be[Cm]come alive, the grave cannot [Ab]hold
{end_of_chorus}

{start_of_verse: Outro}
You [Bb]are led by [Eb]the Spirit
[Ab]Children of [Bb]God forever[Ab][Bb]more
{end_of_verse}

